      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems to be doing the same as when right clicking / pressing the grip button in vr. \nAs I've mentioned here: \nhttps://feedback.vrchat.com/open-beta/p/1137-1144-right-clicking-pressing-the-grab-button-in-vr-will-play-the-button-ani",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
