  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-10-24T06:27:17.164Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "If you are clicking a button in the QM and you move your cursor / controller to fast, you will get the sound and pressing animation but nothing will actually happen. \nIt's not really annoying while in Desktop, because you rarely move your mouse there so fast, but this has often annoyed me while in VR. When I try to open my wings real quick I often only hear the sound etc. but nothing actually happened because of this issue.\nIt seems to be related to the fact that pressing a button will only play the sound and pressing animation and only letting go of it will actually do what the button is supposed to do (open a menu etc).\nHere is a video showing what I mean by this:\nhttps://youtu.be/6qDVcfXBSoU",
